The OPA required tagging policy was updated to remove the hardcoded Project and Environment values and instead validate them using dynamically supplied OPA data through data.tagging.projects and data.tagging.environments[project].

The test file was also updated with mock_tagging data so the existing unit tests can simulate the project and environment information that will come from imac-config/DynamoDB in the actual pipeline. This change meets the Jira requirement to manage project-specific environments centrally in imac-config rather than maintaining those values directly in the OPA policy.
